The design skills described below were vendored under .claude/skills/ during
development. That directory is no longer part of this repository, so none of the
third-party files are present any more. What remains derived from them is the
format of DESIGN.md and the design vocabulary it records; the attributions are
kept for that reason.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
